WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:05.330
Ever wondered about the deepest desire of
SCP-096, the entity that wants nothing more

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:06.839
than to hide its face forever?

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:12.170
Foundation researchers took a photograph of
SCP-096 while it was sitting in its containment

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:17.390
chamber, facing away from the camera, using
SCP-978, the Desire Camera.

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:18.650
This was the result:

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:23.800
"Picture of SCP-096's containment chamber,
taken from the same angle.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.910
SCP-096 is not present in the photograph."

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:32.570
It seems that SCP-096's rage at anyone seeing
its face comes from a simple, heartbreaking

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.370
wish: to disappear.

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:38.540
Another tragic example of a desire that will
never be realized.

